gui.the_long_travail.catalog.glossary.ma:
Magic-type damage includes:
- Magic and indirect magic damage;
- Damage from status effects such as Poison and Wither;
- Reflected damage from Thorns enchantments and Guardian spikes;
- Other environmental damage, such as freezing and lightning;
- Dragon breath, Wither skulls, Ghast fireballs, and Warden sonic booms;
- Damage from touching fire, burning, lava, and magma blocks.

gui.the_long_travail.catalog.glossary.ph:
Physical-type damage includes:
- Melee attack damage from entities;
- Explosion, fall, cramming, and collision damage;
- Damage from falling blocks, anvils, and stalactites;
- Damage from bee stings, cacti, and sweet berry bushes;
- Damage from arrows, tridents, thrown objects, and other projectiles.

gui.the_long_travail.catalog.glossary.ma:
While the effect is active:
- Gain a 30% damage bonus;
- Convert damage dealt into Direct Strike damage;
- When dealing damage, apply Wither II to the target for 5 seconds;
- Lose health equal to 5% of maximum health each second (cannot reduce health below 1).

gui.the_long_travail.catalog.glossary.re:
While the effect is active:
- Damage dealt is reduced by 99%;
- Movement speed is reduced by 50%.

gui.the_long_travail.catalog.glossary.am:
While the effect is active:
- Cannot deal or receive damage;
- Prevents direct health deductions;
- Other mobs cannot select you as an attack or retaliation target.
